# Plugin: Code Review Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers requesting/receiving code review skills for SDDRA R1 arm.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\vkard.az\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\requesting-code-review\SKILL.md
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\vkard.az\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\receiving-code-review\SKILL.md

Original:
  Requesting: Pre-review checklist
  Receiving: Responding to feedback

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Requesting -> AI presents code for human review:
    Checklist:
      - All tests pass
      - Linter passes
      - Decision requirements met
      - Security review passed
      - Documentation updated

  Receiving -> Human feedback workflow:
    Feedback types:
      - APPROVED: proceed to next stage
      - CHANGES_REQUESTED: create revision task
      - REJECTED: archive task, create new decision

  Integration:
    - R1 arm handles review
    - Feedback recorded in decisions/
    - Revision tasks created in .sdd/projects/vkard.az/tasks/

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/arms/review.sdd

  Triggers:
    - C1 arm completes
    - Code ready for review
    - Human review requested

State: Adapted
